{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"rencheng-e-e283e4ca0e2edeff9ec7","title":"明帝答曹植称无禁通问诏，已敕有司依诉处理","accounts":[{"id":"rencheng-a-e283e4ca0e2edeff9ec7","label":"正文","text":"明帝答曹植称无禁通问诏，已敕有司依诉处理","evidence":["rencheng-q-e3e4587ba8699d74d598"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wendi-p0005","role":"答诏者","evidence":["rencheng-q-e3e4587ba8699d74d598"]},{"person":"wudi-p0280","role":"获答者","evidence":["rencheng-q-e3e4587ba8699d74d598"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["rencheng-q-e3e4587ba8699d74d598"]},"ordering_evidence":"rencheng-q-e3e4587ba8699d74d598","order":3806}],"persons":[{"id":"wendi-p0005","name":"曹叡","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0280","name":"曹植","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"rencheng-q-e3e4587ba8699d74d598","section":"chapter-019","block":"b-97b8427a37e9c5b9dfd5","layer":"original","quote":"诏报曰：“盖教化所由，各有隆弊，非皆善始而恶终也，事使之然。故夫忠厚仁及草木，则《行苇》之诗作〖64〗；恩泽衰薄不亲九族，则《角弓》之章刺〖65〗。今令诸国兄弟，情理简怠；妃妾之家，膏沐疏略：朕纵不能敦而睦之，王援古喻义备悉矣。何言精诚不足以感通哉？夫明贵贱，崇亲亲〖66〗；礼贤良，顺少长：国之纲纪。本无禁锢诸国通问之诏也；矫枉过正，下吏惧谴，以至于此耳。已敕有司：如王所诉。”","section_title":"任城陈萧王传第十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0043.xhtml","index":294,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":190}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
